  <p>Proof. We will show that if <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is Type <span data-field="type_val_20">{{ type_val_20 }}</span>, or <span data-field="type_val_21">{{ type_val_21 }}</span>, then <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is not half of a splitting of an r-maximal set. Fix some infinite generating set <span data-field="G_val">{{ G_val }}</span> of D(<span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span>) of Type <span data-field="type_val_22">{{ type_val_22 }}</span>.</p>
  <p>Let <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> be a c.e. set disjoint from <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> such that <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is not Type <span data-field="type_val_23">{{ type_val_23 }}</span>. We show that <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is not r-maximal. Since <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is contained in some finite subset of sets in <span data-field="G_val">{{ G_val }}</span>, every c.e. subset of an r-maximal set is either almost equal to <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> or r-maximal itself. Since <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> does not have Type <span data-field="type_val_24">{{ type_val_24 }}</span> or <span data-field="type_val_25">{{ type_val_25 }}</span>, we can assume <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is the union of these finitely many generators. We proceed by cases. For <span data-field="type_val_26">{{ type_val_26 }}</span> or <span data-field="type_val_27">{{ type_val_27 }}</span>, not part of the union witnesses that <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is not r-maximal. For <span data-field="type_val_28">{{ type_val_28 }}</span> or <span data-field="type_val_29">{{ type_val_29 }}</span>, the finite computable subset of some D(<span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span>) is not part of the union demonstrates that <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is not r-maximal. Finally, suppose <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is Type <span data-field="type_val_30">{{ type_val_30 }}</span>. By the last clause of Type <span data-field="type_val_31">{{ type_val_31 }}</span>, there is an <span data-field="r_val">{{ r_val }}</span> such that <span data-field="R_val">{{ R_val }}</span> is infinite. The computable set <span data-field="R_val">{{ R_val }}</span> witnesses that <span data-field="A_val">{{ A_val }}</span> is not r-maximal.</p>
