    isomorphic to $B$. (Note that $\langle R_i \cap H_i \rangle$ should be thought of as the collection of
    c.e. subsets of $H_i$ that are contained in $R_i$). Then $H$ is isomorphic to a properly
    proper subset of $H \cap \bigcup_{i \in \omega} H_i$. The structures $B$ and $\langle H \cap \bigcup_{i \in \omega} H_i \rangle$ are isomorphic if,
